          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Envoy log files must be shipped via syslog to a central log server.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
        </STIG_DATA>
        <STIG_DATA>
          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Envoy rsyslog configuration is included in the "VMware-visl-integration" package and unpacked to "/etc/vmware-syslog/vmware-services-envoy.conf". Ensuring the package hashes are as expected also ensures the shipped rsyslog configuration is present and unmodified.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
